    (select id from public.regions where slug = 'north-vancouver'), 'published', false, '/images/scenes/sunrise-ridge.svg', 'Short, sweet and spectacular — watch the sun come up over Indian Arm.', 'An early start rewarded with sunrise over Indian Arm from the Quarry Rock bluff. Rooty forest trail with some stairs. We''ll grab coffee in Deep Cove afterwards.',
